# procedural-chart
# State chart: measuring each engine's memory footprint (#29). Instruments: podman stats (cgroup) and /proc/meminfo; nothing is estimated.
direction: down
title: "Engine footprint measurement" {shape: text}

idle: No engine running {shape: oval}
up: One engine started by its own recipe
probed: One real request answered (200)
measured: Container and host memory read

idle -> up: "cmd: just engine-footprint | pass: the engine's recipe exits 0 ('retrieval-up', 'candle-up') after a MemAvailable check of at least 8 GiB"
up -> probed: "cmd: just engine-footprint | pass: the probe request (embeddings, rerank, chat) returns http 200"
probed -> measured: "cmd: just engine-footprint | pass: a table row with 'container MiB' read from podman stats (n/a fails the run)"
measured -> idle: "cmd: just engine-footprint | pass: prints 'PASS engine-footprint' and podman ps -a lists no wattson-embed, wattson-rerank or wattson-candle"
